{
	"about": [
		"Every argument form each agent command's parser accepted at 57dad1c0, read from that parser (git show 57dad1c0:<file>), and the options its logic received, written out by hand.",
		"tool-compatibility.test.ts runs each row through the shared resolver and the command's own argument step. Never regenerate these rows from tool-registry.mjs.",
		"<repo>/x stands for the repository root joined with x; <default-run> for codex:round's fresh D:/fitway-temp/codex-round-<uuid> folder; env sets (or, as null, removes) a variable for the row.",
		"intentionalRefusals lists each argument form a 57dad1c0 parser accepted that the commands now refuse on purpose, with an example and its C3/C4 reason; tool-compatibility.test.ts holds the base inventory of accepted forms, read from those parsers, and fails when one is in neither rows nor intentionalRefusals."
	],
	"commandsWithoutRows": {
		"tools": "new in cb1cfe65; 57dad1c0 had no pnpm tools",
		"evidence:keep": "new in evidence-home; 57dad1c0 had no evidence:keep",
		"run-folder:new": "new in evidence-home; 57dad1c0 had no run-folder:new"
	},
